### Commit Guidelines Recap:
- One commit per discrete fix. **NO MASSIVE COMMITS**.
- **Header**: `[UPG]{{ id_tag }} module_name: Concise description`
  - The `[...]` bracket is the **task/ticket number**{% if task_id %} (`{{ task_id }}`){% endif %} and is identical on every commit.{% if not task_id %} No task id was provided here, so omit the bracket entirely: `[UPG] module_name: ...`.{% endif %}
  - The Odoo commit hash is **NOT** allowed in the header brackets — it belongs only in the body.
  - Correct: `[UPG]{{ id_tag }} new_idimed: rename product_uom to product_uom_id`
  - WRONG:   `[UPG][c8461a5] new_idimed: rename product_uom to product_uom_id` (commit hash in brackets)
- **Body**: Detailed description + **MANDATORY** `Source:` (Odoo Commit SHA made clickable, PR, or Core path).
{% if not no_ruff %}
- **Ruff Sniper**: Run `ruff check <file> --select E999,F821,F822,F405` after Python edits. DO NOT fix unrelated style issues.
{% endif %}
